Attribution / derivative-work notice (AGPL-3.0 §5)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The OpenPrintHQ print engine is a derivative work of "Bambuddy":

    Bambuddy — https://github.com/maziggy/bambuddy
    Copyright (C) maziggy and the Bambuddy contributors
    Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0.

The upstream project's own README, copyright notices, and license are retained
in this repository. OpenPrintHQ continues to license the combined work under
AGPL-3.0-or-later, as required by the upstream license.

Modifications made by OpenPrintHQ relative to upstream Bambuddy include, among
others:

  - Multi-vendor printer support beyond Bambu Lab: Snapmaker adapter and
    extended Klipper/Moonraker, Prusa (PrusaLink), OctoPrint, Duet/RepRap,
    FlashForge and MKS connection types.
  - Integration of OrcaSlicer as the built-in slicer via a sidecar service.
  - A separate multi-tenant control-plane and web frontend (instance-per-user),
    of which this engine is the per-tenant backend.
  - Product rebranding of user-facing strings (API metadata, notification and
    email sender name, MFA issuer) from "Bambuddy" to "OpenPrintHQ".

The authoritative, per-file record of changes is the git history of this
repository. Functional identifiers that form part of an external contract
(e.g. MQTT topic prefixes, environment-variable names, backup archive layout)
have intentionally been left unchanged for compatibility.

