Third-party components used by this engine
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Slicing is provided by OrcaSlicer (https://github.com/SoftFever/OrcaSlicer,
© SoftFever and contributors, AGPL-3.0), run as a sidecar service via
orca-slicer-api (https://github.com/maziggy/orca-slicer-api). OrcaSlicer is
itself derived from BambuStudio (© Bambu Lab), PrusaSlicer (© Prusa Research)
and Slic3r (© Alessandro Ranellucci and contributors), all AGPL-3.0.

This engine also depends on numerous open-source libraries — including FastAPI,
Starlette, Uvicorn, Pydantic, SQLAlchemy, paho-mqtt, httpx, trimesh, OpenCV,
and a React-based web UI — each under its own license (MIT / BSD / Apache-2.0 /
EPL, as applicable). The complete list with versions and licenses is in
requirements.txt and frontend/package.json; each dependency's license text is
distributed with that dependency when the software is built.
